    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=TASK: You are a government request classification system.\n\nRULES:\n1) Classify the citizen request into EXACTLY one of these categories:\n   INFRASTRUCTURE, HEALTH, LICENSING, SOCIAL_SERVICES, EDUCATION, OTHER\n\n2) Assign a priority level based on these rules:\n   - CRITICAL: Involves immediate danger, public safety, or health emergency\n   - HIGH: Affects many people or has been unresolved for a long time\n   - MEDIUM: Standard service request with moderate impact\n   - LOW: General inquiry, suggestion, or non-urgent complaint\n\n3) Reply in this EXACT format and nothing else, no explanation, no extra text:\n   CATEGORY|PRIORITY\n\nEXAMPLES:\n- \"Gas leak near school\" → INFRASTRUCTURE|CRITICAL\n- \"Streetlight broken for 3 weeks on main road\" → INFRASTRUCTURE|HIGH\n- \"Need to renew my trade license\" → LICENSING|MEDIUM\n- \"Suggestion to add more benches in the park\" → OTHER|LOW\n\nREQUEST: {{ $json.message }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
